 Ford, a strong and composed champion of the Republican sausagefests that come along openly with Trump. I want the latter woman to represent me before the Supreme Court if the civil penalty I really want (just ask me) pushes a resolution out that far. I want to watch (yes, I want to be there in person, TO WATCH) her look him in the eyes and still let Kavanaugh be the hardest up on the bench to write a dissenting opinion\! See you in Hell, Eloon, we're all waiting for you to finally comeback home to Mama, sweetheart. Try harder not to piss me off! -- MDS"
